---
const currentYear = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="bg-white dark:bg-slate-950 border-t border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 py-12 mt-20 transition-colors">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 mb-8 pb-8 border-b border-slate-100 dark:border-slate-800">
      <div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-3">
          <div class="w-6 h-6 rounded-lg bg-sky-500 flex items-center justify-center text-white text-xs font-bold">
            ⚡
          </div>
          <span class="text-sm font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">
            网络节点与加速工具测评网
          </span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
          专注于全球网络节点性能实测、晚高峰丢包压测、AI与流媒体解锁能力评测，为开发者与跨国业务提供客观选型数据。
        </p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h4 class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white uppercase tracking-wider mb-3">
          快捷导航
        </h4>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-xs text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">
          <li><a href="/#popular" class="hover:text-sky-500">🔥 热门节点推荐</a></li>
          <li><a href="/monitor" class="hover:text-sky-500">📊 5 维监测打分大盘</a></li>
          <li><a href="/posts" class="hover:text-sky-500">📚 客户端教程与评测归档</a></li>
          <li><a href="/about" class="hover:text-sky-500">⚖️ 免责声明与合规说明</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h4 class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white uppercase tracking-wider mb-3">
          合规与免责提示
        </h4>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
          本站所有内容仅用于网络性能测试技术交流与学术讨论。请使用者严格遵守当地法律法规，倡导合法合规上网。
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4 text-xs text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">
      <p>© {currentYear} 极速节点测评网. Powered by Astro 5.x & Tailwind CSS.</p>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
        <a href="/sitemap-index.xml" target="_blank" class="hover:underline hover:text-sky-500">Sitemap XML</a>
        <span>•</span>
        <a href="/robots.txt" target="_blank" class="hover:underline hover:text-sky-500">Robots.txt</a>
        <span>•</span>
        <a href="/about" class="hover:underline hover:text-sky-500">免责声明</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
